#: matcolex/__init__.py:393
msgid "1. Create a folder (Add Icon ✚)."
msgstr "1. 创建文件夹（添加图标 ✚）。"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:403
msgid "1. Select the target object(s)."
msgstr "1. 选择目标物体。"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:404
msgid "2. **Select the desired slot in Blender's Material Slots panel.**"
msgstr "2. **在 Blender 的材质槽面板中选择所需槽位。**"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:394
msgid "2. Select the object containing materials."
msgstr "2. 选择包含材质的物体。"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:395
msgid "3. Click 'Add Active' (in the Material List)."
msgstr "3. 点击“添加活动项”（在材质列表中）。"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:405
msgid "3. Select a material from the list."
msgstr "3. 从列表中选择一个材质。"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:15
msgid "3D View"
msgstr "3D 视图"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:406
msgid "4. Click Apply (✓ icon) next to the material."
msgstr "4. 点击材质旁边的应用（✓ 图标）。"

#: matcolex/__init__.py:15
msgid "Collect and organize materials. Features stable parameter controls, interactive material slot control, and reliable material assignment."
msgstr "收集并整理材质。具有稳定的参数控制、交互式材质槽控制和可靠的材质指定。"

